  "bodyHash": "816d14722c610eb4",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img alt=\"Wildlife Banner Image\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VY8MNuM.png\" width=\"1000\" height=\"686\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>重要提示：</strong>本模組需要 Geckolib for Fabric。Patchouli 為選配，但閱讀指南書時為必要條件。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>支援的模組載入器：</strong>Fabric</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color: #ff9900;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; color: #ff9900;\"><br /></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"><strong>模組亮點：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">為世界新增 74 種不同的動物與昆蟲。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">昆蟲與小型動物可透過右鍵點擊來捕捉或釋放。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">每種鳴禽都有獨特的鳴叫聲。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">小型動物可以放置在玩家頭頂及物品展示框上。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">稀有的白化變體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">內附 Patchouli 指南書，提供每種動物的描述與插圖。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">包含設定檔，可用於調整生成位置與頻率。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><em>&nbsp;手持空手右鍵點擊即可捕捉小型動物，若放置於玩家頭頂則會騎乘其上 ^_^</em><br /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img alt=\"A series of screenshots showing how to pick up a chickadee\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tJktzRs.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"387\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>鳥類</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"height: 439px;\" width=\"842\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">藍鳥</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">黑冠山雀</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">棉鳥</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">朱紅霸鶲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">金翅雀</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">雲雀沙鵐</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">草原百靈</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">黃鸝</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">褐喉鶲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">知更鳥</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">麻雀</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">燕子</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">唧鹀</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">白眼維雀</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">鷦鷯&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Birds\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/coi8t63.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"396\" /></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>哺乳類</strong></span><strong><br />_______________________________________________________________________________ <br /><br /></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rek1GIg.png\" alt=\"Mammals\" width=\"870\" height=\"450\" /></span></p>\n<table style=\"height: 144px;\" width=\"421\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">食蟻獸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">犰狳</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">獾</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">河狸</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">野豬<br /><img alt=\"Spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"25\" /></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">水豚</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">鹿</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">雪貂</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">倉鼠</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"25\" /><br /></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">刺猬</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">猴子</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">豪豬</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">負鼠</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\"  width=\"200\" height=\"25\" /></span><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><br /></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>爬蟲類</strong></span><strong><br />_______________________________________________________________________________ <br /><br /></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Reptiles\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kTYBQBj.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"346\" /></span></p>\n<table style=\"height: 110px;\" width=\"477\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">變色龍<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">壁虎</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">草蛇</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">鬣蜥<br /></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\"  src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"25\" /></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">王蛇<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">乳蛇</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">蟒蛇<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">短吻鱷<br /></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"25\" /></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>魚類與水生生物</strong><strong><br />_______________________________________________________________________________ <br /><br /></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Fish and Aquatic Creatures\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/6ycGdtw.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"498\" /></span></p>\n<table style=\"height: 177px;\" width=\"950\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">金魚</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">鬥魚</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">藍鰓太陽魚</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">鯰魚<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">錦鯉</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">蝦</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">海馬<br /></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" /></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">海馬</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">水母<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">淡水蝦</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">發光水母</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">海膽</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">蛤蜊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">鲎<br /></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" /></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">海星</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">沙錢</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">魟魚</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">蝠鱝<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">鮟鱇魚</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">錘頭鯊</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">虹鱒<br /></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" /></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>昆蟲與節肢動物</strong><strong><br />_______________________________________________________________________________ <br /><br /></strong><br /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/d9QF0ld.png\" alt=\"Insects and Arthropods\" width=\"1000\" height=\"400\" /></span></p>\n<table style=\"height: 177px;\" width=\"950\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">螞蟻</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">蟋蟀</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">蜻蜓</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">玻璃翼蝶<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">六月金龜子</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">瓢蟲<br /></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" /></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">帝王斑蝶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">藍閃蝶<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">犀金龜</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">蝸牛</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">香葉木斑蝶</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">蜘蛛<br /></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img alt=\"Spacer image\" alt=\"spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" /></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">鹿角鍬形蟲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">竹節蟲</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">向日葵金龜子</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">虎紋鳳蝶<br /></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">螃蟹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">寄居蟹<br /></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img  alt=\"spacer image\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/lYvYORa.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"25\" /></span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><em><strong>與 Patchouli 相容：<br /></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在野生生物上使用書籍即可開啟指南書。</span></em> <br /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><em><strong>_______________________________________________________________________________ <br /></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img alt=\"A screenshot of the Patchouli guidebook.\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HLZOQjY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1108\" height=\"586\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><em><strong>物品展示框：</strong></em><br /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><em><strong>_______________________________________________________________________________ <br /><br /></strong></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img alt=\"A screenshot of the itemframes\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rn3xnT4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"738\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><img alt=\"Thank you banner\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/866521661880795147/880298426808565770/andspecialthanks21.png\" alt=\"Acknowledgements and special thanks\" width=\"320\" height=\"64\" /></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">特別感謝專案的贊助者：<strong>Zura、Lavie、Kree、Atlan、Le flémmard、Eugene Nubberslaw、Azilea_Royalty 以及 Nil！</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果您喜歡本模組，歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chirpycricket\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Patreon</a> 支持開發者！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
